DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T170000
DTSTAMP:20260707T153938Z
UID:smcl-6a28871c43b41b3d006d2075@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to dive into the wonderful world of sewing? Join
  us in the Atherton Makerspace every third Tuesday of the month for Jr. Se
 wing Machine Basics. If you're a curious beginner or just looking for a fu
 n new skill\, Jr. Sewing is the perfect starting point. This class is spe
 cifically designed for kids aged 6-18. We'll teach you the basics\, from t
 hreading a needle to winding a bobbin.\n\nWith hands-on practice\, kids wi
 ll also create a simple sewing project to take home\, leaving with new ski
 lls and something they made themselves.\n\nNo experience is needed. All ma
 terials will be provided. Space is limited\, so be sure to sign up online 
 at smcl.org or ask a staff member to assist you with registration.\n\nAges
 : 6-11\, 12-18\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons
 .com/events/6a28871c43b41b3d006d2075\nLast synced: 2026-07-07 08:39 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a28871c43b41b3d006d2075
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] Jurassic Jabber Paleontology
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260730T170000
DTSTAMP:20260707T153938Z
UID:smcl-69fb6edb703c33630025d57e@local-events
DESCRIPTION:There is so much to learn about dinosaurs! Join dino expert Be
 n Manarello as he discusses 240 million years of information about these c
 aptivating creatures. We will learn about the dinosaurs' ways of life\, di
 fferent kinds of fossils\, and the science and technology behind uncoverin
 g our prehistoric past. Touch life-size replicas of huge T. rex skulls and
  interact with hands-on tools and artifacts. Plus\, kids can take home the
 ir own authentic fossil! Jurassic Jabber is scientific fun for the whole f
 amily\, and all ages are welcome.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSourc
 e: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69fb6edb703c33630025d57e\nLast sy
 nced: 2026-07-07 08:39 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton Library\, 2 Dinkelspiel Station Ln\, Atherton\, CA 94027
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69fb6edb703c33630025d57e
END:VEVENT
